switch your vote to Joe Biden

00:42:29.380 --> 00:42:31.440
than you are to switch to Donald Trump.

00:42:31.440 --> 00:42:34.600
So independents are moving toward Biden.

00:42:34.600 --> 00:42:36.980
But I wanna just say
