crisis, of the pandemic.

00:43:04.460 --> 00:43:07.470
And concern about COVID is associated

00:43:07.470 --> 00:43:11.020
with switching
disproportionately to Joe Biden.

00:43:11.020 --> 00:43:14.570
And let me just show you one table

