say I'm somewhat concerned

00:43:38.160 --> 00:43:41.320
about Coronavirus, that's a lot of people

00:43:41.320 --> 00:43:43.170
if you add those two number together.

00:43:43.170 --> 00:43:47.430
Those people are switching in
