are switching to Biden,

00:43:59.900 --> 00:44:03.160
and 6% of the 34% who
are somewhat concerned.

00:44:03.160 --> 00:44:06.380
So that's a lot of people who
are worried about the virus

00:44:06.380 --> 00:44:08.290
switching to Biden.

00:44:08.290 --> 00:44:12.760
The same is not true for
Clinton voters in '16.

00:44:12.760 --> 00:44:15.570
Most of them are also
