01:18:37.890 --> 01:18:40.980
See the website for more details.

01:18:40.980 --> 01:18:42.970
With that, I thank you all

01:18:42.970 --> 01:18:45.570
for spending the time with us this evening

01:18:45.570 --> 01:18:50.060
and I hope to see you
